1
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,300
I feel heroic!
我感觉自己好英勇！

2
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,100
And handsome.
而且好帅。

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,300
I'm a little wet, but I still look good.
有点湿，但我看上去还是很帅。

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,600
I look good.
我确实帅。

5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,800
Are you... are you okay?
你……你没事吧？

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,800
I'm good. I'm good.
我没事，我没事。

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,300
Thanks for coming to save me, Max.
谢谢你赶来救我，麦克斯。

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,500
Max! Max!
麦克斯！麦克斯！

9
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,800
Lobidubedo!
万岁！

10
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,800
You need a lift?
要搭个车吗？

11
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,400
Yes, we need a lift! Let's go, Tattoo!
要，我们需要搭车！走吧，纹纹！

12
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,300
Let's go!
走吧！

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,300
Taxi!
出租车！

14
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:15,600
Hey, hey... Uh, Gidget, wait up.
嘿，嘿……琪琪，等等我。

15
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,500
Oh, hi, Max.
哦，嗨，麦克斯。

16
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Yeah. Hi. Um...
嗯。嗨。呃……

17
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,300
Play it cool.
淡定，装酷。

18
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:24,800
Yeah, I... I just wanted to...
嗯，我……我只是想说……

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,900
Look. Have you ever lived across from someone your whole life,
你看，有没有这样一个人，住在你对面一辈子，

20
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,600
but you don't really appreciate them, until... I don't know,
你却一直没真正在意，直到……我也不知道，

21
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,300
until they're beating up dozens of animals on the Brooklyn Bridge?
直到看见他在布鲁克林大桥上揍翻一群动物？

22
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,900
I guess what I'm trying to say is... if you ever wanna...
我想说的是……如果你愿意的话……

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,400
Okay!
好啊！

24
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,300
Great. You're in love.
好极了。你恋爱了。

25
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,100
How gross for everyone. Now move it!
恶心到所有人了。快走开！

26
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,100
Good-bye! See you later! Good-bye!
再见！回头见！再见！

27
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,300
Does anyone know where we are?
有人知道我们在哪儿吗？

28
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,600
Bye, Max.
再见，麦克斯。

29
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,900
Bye, Gidget.
再见，琪琪。

30
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:55,100
Okay, bye-bye!
好，拜拜！

31
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:56,000
See you guys.
大家再见。

32
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,300
Man, I feel sorry for them.
唉，我真替他们难过。

33
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,600
Gotta run home to their owners.
还得赶回家找主人。

34
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:05,600
Not us. Now, it's back to our primary mission.
我们就不用。现在，回到我们的首要任务。

35
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,300
The downfall of the human race!
推翻人类统治！

36
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,300
It is on, humans! It is on!
开战吧，人类！开战！

37
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,300
Yeah!
耶！

38
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,100
Mommy, can I have a bunny?
妈妈，我能养只兔子吗？

39
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,900
And a pig and a crocodile and a lizard?
还有猪、鳄鱼和蜥蜴？

40
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:22,900
Uh-oh.
糟了。

41
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,600
Yey! Bunny!
耶！兔子！

42
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,900
Jab, jab, jab! Body blow! Body blow!
刺拳，刺拳，刺拳！击腹！击腹！

43
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,100
Break-away move!
闪身！

44
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,600
What's going on? What's she doing?
怎么回事？她在干什么？

45
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,600
Bunny, I'm gonna love you forever and ever and ever.
兔子，我要永远永远永远爱你。

46
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,600
Aww... Bunny.
哇……兔子。

47
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:51,300
Duke, this is the best part of the day.
杜克，这是一天里最棒的时刻。

48
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,900
Ooh! Is that her?
哦！是她吗？

49
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,600
Nah, no. That's...
不，不是。那是……

50
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:58,100
Wait... Yeah, that's her. That's her. Katie!
等等……对，就是她。就是她。凯蒂！

51
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:04,900
There they are! Max and Duke, Duke and Max!
他们在那儿！麦克斯和杜克，杜克和麦克斯！

52
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,900
Aw! My boys! So how did it go?
哦！我的宝贝们！怎么样啊？

53
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,100
Great, right? I... Uh... So, maybe a few bumps.
很棒，对吧？我……呃……是有点小波折。

54
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:18,900
But I knew this was gonna work out.
但我就知道会顺利的。

55
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,100
So, who's hungry?
那么，谁饿了？

56
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:35,600
Welcome home, Duke.
欢迎回家，杜克。

57
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,900
Thank you, Max.
谢谢你，麦克斯。

